{
  "$comment": "澳洲政策雷达启动信源。默认启用5个已验证解析的官方来源；其余为明确暂停的候选配置，须在后台试抓并补全日期、选择器后启用。启动仅补充新ID，不删除或覆盖已有信源。详见 docs/australia.md。内政部接口按自然年查询，跨年前需在后台更新 Year。",
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "au-home-affairs-news",
      "name": "澳洲内政部：移民与公民新闻",
      "kind": "json_list",
      "config": {
        "acceptLanguage": "en-AU,en;q=0.9",
        "_aihot": {
          "initialBackfillLimit": 5
        },
        "url": "https://immi.homeaffairs.gov.au/_layouts/15/api/Data.aspx/GetNews",
        "mode": "json_api",
        "method": "POST",
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json"
        },
        "bodyJson": {
          "siteUrl": "https://www.homeaffairs.gov.au",
          "webUrl": "/News-subsite",
          "filter": {
            "Month": null,
            "Year": "2026",
            "Categories": [],
            "PageNumber": 1,
            "RowLimit": 100,
            "ShowCurrentSiteOnly": true,
            "CurrentSite": "Immi"
          }
        },
        "itemsPath": "d.data",
        "titlePaths": [
          "Title"
        ],
        "summaryPaths": [
          "Content"
        ],
        "summaryIsBody": true,
        "publishedAtPath": "Date",
        "externalIdPath": "Id",
        "urlTemplate": "https://immi.homeaffairs.gov.au/news-media/archive/article?itemId={Id}"
      },
      "tier": "T1",
      "owner_entity_id": "home-affairs",
      "participation_mode": "editorial",
      "interval_minutes": 240,
      "tags": [
        "官方"
      ],
      "site_fulltext": false,
      "syndicate_fulltext": false
    },
